      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    face_value = 100_000\n    annual_coupon_rate = 0.05\n    annual_market_rate = 0.04\n    years_to_maturity = 10\n    payments_per_year = 2\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    period_rate = annual_market_rate / payments_per_year\n    coupon_payment = face_value * annual_coupon_rate / payments_per_year\n    total_payments = years_to_maturity * payments_per_year\n\n    present_value = sum(\n        coupon_payment / (1 + period_rate) ** period\n        for period in range(1, total_payments + 1)\n    )\n    present_value += face_value / (1 + period_rate) ** total_payments\n\n    # Return the answer rounded to the nearest dollar\n    return round(present_value)\n```",
